     1	#!/usr/bin/env python3
     2	"""Sandbox environment setup and dependency installation for public SWE-bench repositories.
     3	
     4	This script runs inside the evaluation sandbox container prior to test execution.
     5	It discovers dependencies from pyproject.toml, setup.cfg, and requirements files,
     6	resolves compatible pre-baked wheels from /wheels, configures git exclude rules,
     7	installs the workspace package in editable mode, and configures pytest discovery.
     8	"""
