     1	# `swegemma` Evaluation Harness & Competitor Guide
     2	
     3	This document provides a complete technical reference for the **`swegemma`** evaluation harness and its companion libraries (**`adk-submission`** and **`adk-eval-core`**). It explains how competitor submissions are validated and compiled, how the harness orchestrates agent sessions and sandboxes, how the built-in tools behave, and how generated patches are extracted and graded.
     4	
     5	---
     6	
     7	## Table of Contents
     8	
     9	1. [System Architecture & Library Stack](#1-system-architecture--library-stack)
    10	2. [Submission Contract & Declarative Agent Schema (`adk-submission`)](#2-submission-contract--declarative-agent-schema-adk-submission)
    11	3. [Model Registry, Single-Model Rule & LoRA Adapters on 4x L4 GPUs](#3-model-registry-single-model-rule--lora-adapters-on-4x-l4-gpus)
    12	4. [Two-Phase Evaluation Lifecycle](#4-two-phase-evaluation-lifecycle)
    13	5. [Harness-to-Agent Interaction Protocol](#5-harness-to-agent-interaction-protocol)
    14	6. [Built-In Tools Reference (`swegemma.tools`)](#6-built-in-tools-reference-swegemmatools)
    15	7. [Budgets, Operational Limits & Context Management](#7-budgets-operational-limits--context-management)
    16	8. [Patch Extraction & Phase 2 Verification (`verify_task`)](#8-patch-extraction--phase-2-verification-verify_task)
    17	9. [Local CLI Usage & Output Artifacts](#9-local-cli-usage--output-artifacts)
    18	10. [Competitor Best Practices & Important Gotchas](#10-competitor-best-practices--important-gotchas)
    19	
    20	---
    21	
    22	## 1. System Architecture & Library Stack
    23	
    24	The evaluation stack is composed of three cooperating libraries:
    25	
    26	| Package | Role in the Competition Stack |
    27	| :--- | :--- |
    28	| **`adk-submission`** | **Declarative Agent Compiler & Inference Server Manager.** Compiles untrusted submission directories (`agent.yaml`, prompts, sub-agents, skills, and PEFT/LoRA adapters) into live Google ADK `BaseAgent` trees (`compile_submission`) without executing arbitrary competitor Python code (`importlib` is never used). Also manages the local `VllmServer` and `TransformersServer` processes. |
    29	| **`adk-eval-core`** | **Core Evaluation Infrastructure.** Provides base task/result models (`BenchmarkTask`, `BaseTaskResult`, `EvaluationResult`), sandbox execution backends (`DockerContainer`, `SubprocessSandbox`), resilient 3-tier file editing (`apply_replacement`), token/cost tracking (`TokenBudget`, `PricingTable`), ADK plugins (`EventDisplayPlugin`, `ModelRetryPlugin`), and ATIF v1.7 trajectory tracing (`SessionTrace`). |
    30	| **`swegemma`** | **SWE-bench Harness & Scoring Engine.** Implements the two-container SWE evaluation lifecycle (`Evaluator`, `run_agent_sandbox`, `verify_task`), binds the 9 sandboxed workspace and code-intelligence tools (`SwegemmaContext.create_tools()`), constructs the task prompt and continuation nudges, extracts unified git diffs (`scripts/inference.py`), and runs hermetic `pytest` + JUnit XML verification (`scripts/metric.py`). |
    31	
    32	```mermaid
    33	flowchart TB
    34	    subgraph Submission["Competitor Submission (submission.zip / agent_dir)"]
    35	        YAML["agent.yaml + sub_agents/*.yaml"]
    36	        EvalCfg["eval_config.yaml (Optional Budgets)"]
    37	        Prompts["prompts/*.md, configs/*.yaml"]
    38	        Adapters["adapters/* (Optional LoRA / Weights)"]
    39	    end
    40	
    41	    subgraph Host["Harness Process (swegemma + adk-submission + adk-eval-core)"]
    42	        Validator["validate_directory & validate_single_declared_model"]
    43	        Server["Local Inference Server (vLLM / Transformers :8000)"]
    44	        Compiler["compile_submission() -> ADK Runner"]
    45	        Tools["SwegemmaContext (9 Bound Tools + Budget Gate)"]
    46	    end
    47	
    48	    subgraph Sandboxes["Isolated Per-Task Sandboxes"]
    49	        ContA["Container A: Agent Sandbox (/workspace)\nSnapshot + Editable Install + Baseline Commit"]
    50	        ContB["Container B: Verification Sandbox (/workspace)\nFresh Snapshot + agent_patch + test_patch + pytest"]
    51	    end
    52	
    53	    Submission --> Validator
    54	    EvalCfg --> Host
    55	    Adapters --> Server
